 layered light-green and white Hanfu of linen-like textured fabric; the sheer outer robe and wide sleeves drift backward in the breeze. Behind her, weathered wooden pillars, ornate lattice doors, and heavy tiled roofs fall into cool shadow. The color grade is desaturated teal-blue and muted green, high contrast between the lit face and the deep architectural darkness. Shallow depth of field, photorealistic Shaw Brothers wuxia film still mood, 16:9 framing."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 5, "widgets_values_named": {"prompt": "A cinematic low-angle medium shot of a young East Asian woman standing under the dark eaves of an ancient wooden Chinese courtyard at dusk. She is placed slightly right of center in a three-quarter profile, looking upward and away with a pensive, melancholic expression. Her pale skin catches a soft side rim light that traces her cheek, nose, and neck. Long dark hair is gathered in a traditional updo, with loose wispy strands blown across her face by the wind. She wears layered light-green and white Hanfu of linen-like textured fabric; the sheer outer robe and wide sleeves drift backward in the breeze. Behind her, weathered wooden pillars, ornate lattice doors, and heavy tiled roofs fall into cool shadow. The color grade is desaturated teal-blue and muted green, high contrast between the lit face and the deep architectural darkness. Shallow depth of field, photorealistic Shaw Brothers wuxia film still mood, 16:9 framing."}}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.57.1", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds":